{"who":"Claude","text":"Yes, it's open Mondays: in winter (October to March) it's open daily, 9.30am to 5pm, with last entry an hour before closing. It's closed 25 and 26 December. Online adult tickets looked like roughly £20 to £21.50, but sources conflict, so check the current price at https://www.edinburghcastle.scot","oracle":true,"question":"@claude is Edinburgh Castle open on Mondays in winter and how much is a ticket","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-28T19:31","checkin":"2026-11-28T19:31"}
